menu "Fractonica capabilities"

    config FR_TEST_HOOKS
        bool "Test hooks (inject commands, diag call)"
        default n
        help
            Compiles capability commands with `visibility: test` (fr.button inject, ...) and the
            diag `call`/`inject` JSON codecs. Set by sdkconfig.build.debug; never on in release
            builds, where those commands answer UNSUPPORTED.

endmenu
